Pounchi khaber jo khaime mein abbas margaye<br>
saidaniyoun ke sunte hi chehre utar gaye<br>
<br>
1. ab tak palat ke aaye na nehre furaat se<br>
ammu ko mere der huwi ghaat par gaye<br>
<br>
2. bazoo huwe khalam to na tha dil ka kuch alam<br>
mashkeeza chid gaya to alamdar margaye<br>
<br>
3. karbobala mein akber-o-asghar ki shakl mein<br>
sab fatima ke haar ke moti bhikar gaye<br>
<br>
4. bachoun se ro ke baali sakina ne yeh kaha<br>
ab kya milega paani chacha jaan margaye<br>
<br>
5. bole yeh shai behan se ke zainab ghazab huwa<br>
jis par tha humko naaz wo abbas margaye